{
  "description": "You gain the service of a familiar, a spirit that takes an animal form you choose from a list of CR-0 Beasts. The familiar has the statistics of the chosen form, though it is a Celestial, Fey, or Fiend (your choice) instead of a Beast. It obeys your commands, acts on its own Initiative, and cannot attack. While within 100 feet you can communicate telepathically and as a Bonus Action see/hear through its senses. It can deliver your touch spells. It disappears at 0 HP and is replaced by recasting; One Familiar Only.",
